# KNOWN deployed-only files: they live in a surface install.sh deploys to, and
# are tracked in NO repo on this machine. PINNED and SHRINK-ONLY — reported on
# every run, not fatal, because a check that refuses every commit gets bypassed
# and then guards nothing. A file NOT listed here fails immediately.
#
# Enumerated 2026-09-22 after four were found by accident in one day. A file
# here is restorable by nobody: install.sh cannot carry what it does not track,
# and the bait runner discovers forms through git, so these are invisible to the
# coverage gate as well.
#
# Removing a line is the only legal direction, and each removal is a decision
# about WHERE the file belongs — this repo, ~/.git-hooks, or deliberately
# ephemeral. That is the operator's ruling, not this file's.
#
# Already closed: skill_share.sh (2026-09-22) — install.sh CALLED it without
# copying it, and it is the scrubber that keeps private references out of
# published skills.
_hook_is_compact.py
action_report.py
beacon-researcher.md
guard_bash_writes.sh
guard_collision.sh
guard_mind_first.py
